 "limitations": [
  "n3_pool is conditioned on having PASSED the Pin 2 screen, so it measures the residual admission leaves and cannot estimate Pin 2's own false-refusal rate.",
  "n2 carries the same host and the same insert as the contig it is a null for, so it cannot separate noise from genuine homology present in BOTH; n3, which carries no insert at all, is what bounds the host channel.",
  "A null maximum is an extreme-value statistic: it rises with the number of sequences searched, so it is reported beside n_null_sequences and never as a fixed property."
 ],
